  "bodyHash": "190c45bb26366429",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>简介</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这是一个最初为朋友设计的整合包，但在花费了大量时间制作后，我决定将其公开，让其他人也能享受更好的单块世界体验！</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">欢迎随时分享任何<span style=\"color:#169179\">建议</span>，或报告你发现的任何<span style=\"color:#169179\">漏洞</span>、<span style=\"color:#169179\">故障</span><span style=\"color:#169179\">！</span><br></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span>请在<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">更新</span>整合包之前<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">备份<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你的</span>存档</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span><br></span></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;该整合包基于原版单块世界“模组”，玩家出生在一个草方块上，必须打破它才能进入下一阶段并解锁更多方块。其中包含<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">0</span></strong>个结构类模组，这使得整合包非常容易更新。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>性能优化</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">它应该是</span>&nbsp;<strong>有史以来性能最强的整合包！</strong>它拥有超过<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">45个性能优化类模组</span>，所有内容<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">仅从单块世界开始</span>，其余模组都是小型附加组件和模组库，目前最大的模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a>。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>常见问题</strong></h1>\n<p>问：“如何创建新世界？”</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>答：目前，你必须使用位于“创建新世界”按钮下方的“重新生成”功能。</p>\n</div>\n<p>问：“护甲不提供保护/不生效。”</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>答：保护机制是有效的！血条上方的指示图标只是被资源包隐藏了，因为我觉得没有理由让它显示在 HUD 上。未来它会移入物品栏中显示。</p>\n</div>\n<p>问：“无限耐久度？”</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如何关闭：打开你的 mods 文件夹并删除“What Durability?”模组。</p>\n<p>原因：耐久度往往让人觉得繁琐而非有意义，尤其是大多数人本来就会使用“经验修补”，这实际上让耐久度变得无关紧要。此模组还能让金制工具变得实用！</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frazvangn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_b209548d-33c6-4553-b2f4-4b01b2e64f44.png\" width=\"476\" height=\"80\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/AeuBs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_4b9c9228-1223-419b-92e7-756819aad08f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"></a></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">计划添加的功能：</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>以下模组可能会根据兼容性、功能和需求进行添加或不添加：</em><br><br><em>更多独特的相关进度。</em><br><em>原版物品的自定义合成配方。</em><br><em>禁止生物破坏地形。</em></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cursery</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleGen</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sneaky Curses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-tabs-updated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tabs</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vectorientation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vectorientation</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mobtimizations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobtimizations</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-snow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Snow</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smooth-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Particles</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fluid-void-fading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluid Void Fading</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/whats-that-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">What's That Slot?</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Crosshair</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beneath-the-wetlands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beneath the Wetlands</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backported-spears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backported Spears</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Portals</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Furniture</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fxs-rail-optimization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FX's Rail Optimization</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coffeegs-awful-lightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoffeeG's Awful Lightning!</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> vs <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Handcrafted</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-progressive-bosses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressive Bosses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillatweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VanillaTweaks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/odds-ends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odds &amp; Ends</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-fixes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpet-Fixes</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblin-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Goblin Traders</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Starlight</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold my Items</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreCulling</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blanket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blanket</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/everything-animated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Everything Animated!</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky OneBlock - Lucky Blocks</a></p>",
